<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Bizzlo Visa Readiness Deck</title>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Bizzlo Visa Readiness Deck</h1>
  <h2>File readiness checklist</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Offer letter or admission confirmation uploaded and approved.</li>
    <li>Deposit proof, fee receipt, or university payment confirmation collected.</li>
    <li>CAS, I-20, COE, or destination-specific visa document requested and tracked.</li>
    <li>Passport validity, academic documents, English test, SOP, and CV checked for consistency.</li>
    <li>Bank statement and funding proof checked for amount, age, sponsor relationship, and format.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Interview preparation</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Student can explain course choice, university choice, destination logic, career plan, and funding source.</li>
    <li>Any study gap, refusal, low score, or course change has a clear written explanation.</li>
    <li>Partner counselor confirms contact details and emergency backup documents before filing.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Risk flags</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Mismatch between SOP, application form, passport, transcript, and financial sponsor details.</li>
    <li>Unapproved document, pending scan status, or missing admin note before filing.</li>
    <li>Deposit paid but no visa-stage follow-up task assigned.</li>
  </ul>
</body>
</html>
